<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN" data-theme="dark">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>{{ title }} · {{ date }}</title>
<meta name="description" content="GitHub 上 AI 相关开源库的每周排名：周增量主榜、新面孔、分类子榜与趋势。">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fira+Code:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Fira+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Noto+Sans+SC:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
/* ---------- 设计令牌（亮/暗两套，暗色为默认） ---------- */
:root {
  --bg: #FFFFFF;
  --surface: #F8FAFC;
  --surface-2: #F1F5F9;
  --text: #0F172A;
  --text-2: #475569;
  --border: #CBD5E1;
  --accent: #16A34A;
  --accent-soft: rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.12);
  --destructive: #DC2626;
  --focus: #15803D;
  --shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.06);
  color-scheme: light dark;
}
[data-theme="dark"] {
  --bg: #0F172A;
  --surface: #1E293B;
  --surface-2: #272F42;
  --text: #F8FAFC;
  --text-2: #94A3B8;
  --border: #475569;
  --accent: #22C55E;
  --accent-soft: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.14);
  --destructive: #EF4444;
  --focus: #4ADE80;
  --shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
}
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
body {
  margin: 0;
  background: var(--bg);
  color: var(--text);
  font-family: "Fira Sans", "Noto Sans SC", "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
  font-size: 16px;
  line-height: 1.6;
  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
}
.mono, .num, code, .rank {
  font-family: "Fira Code", "SFMono-Regular", Consolas, monospace;
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
}
a { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none; }
a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
:focus-visible {
  outline: 3px solid var(--focus);
  outline-offset: 2px;
  border-radius: 4px;
}
.skip-link {
  position: absolute;
  left: -9999px;
  top: 0;
  background: var(--surface);
  color: var(--text);
  padding: 8px 16px;
  z-index: 100;
  border-radius: 0 0 8px 0;
}
.skip-link:focus { left: 0; }

/* ---------- 头部 ---------- */
.site-header {
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  background: var(--surface);
  position: sticky;
  top: 0;
  z-index: 50;
}
.header-inner {
  max-width: 1100px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 14px 20px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 16px;
}
.brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; min-width: 0; }
.brand svg { flex: none; color: var(--text); }
.brand h1 {
  margin: 0;
  font-size: 20px;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.2px;
}
.subtitle {
  margin: 2px 0 0;
  font-size: 13px;
  color: var(--text-2);
  white-space: nowrap;
  overflow: hidden;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
}
.theme-toggle {
  flex: none;
  width: 44px;
  height: 44px;
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 10px;
  background: var(--surface-2);
  color: var(--text);
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: background 180ms ease, border-color 180ms ease;
}
.theme-toggle:hover { border-color: var(--accent); }
[data-theme="dark"] .icon-sun { display: block; }
[data-theme="dark"] .icon-moon { display: none; }
.icon-sun { display: none; }
.icon-moon { display: block; }

/* ---------- 布局 ---------- */
main {
  max-width: 1100px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 24px 20px 48px;
}
section { margin-top: 40px; }
h2 {
  font-size: 22px;
  font-weight: 700;
  margin: 0 0 4px;
  border-left: 4px solid var(--accent);
  padding-left: 10px;
}
h3 { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; margin: 28px 0 10px; }
.section-note { margin: 0 0 16px; color: var(--text-2); font-size: 14px; }

/* ---------- 摘要卡片 ---------- */
.stats-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  gap: 12px;
  margin-top: 24px;
}
.stat-card {
  background: var(--surface);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 12px;
  padding: 16px;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow);
}
.stat-value {
  font-family: "Fira Code", monospace;
  font-size: 26px;
  font-weight: 700;
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  color: var(--accent);
}
.stat-label { font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-2); margin-top: 2px; }

/* ---------- 表格 ---------- */
.table-scroll { overflow-x: auto; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 12px; }
table {
  width: 100%;
  border-collapse: collapse;
  background: var(--surface);
  min-width: 760px;
}
th, td {
  padding: 10px 14px;
  text-align: left;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  vertical-align: top;
}
th {
  font-size: 12px;
  letter-spacing: 0.4px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--text-2);
  background: var(--surface-2);
  position: sticky;
  top: 73px;
  z-index: 1;
}
tbody tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
tbody tr:hover { background: var(--surface-2); }
td.num { text-align: right; white-space: nowrap; }
th.num { text-align: right; }
.rank { color: var(--text-2); font-weight: 600; }
.repo-desc {
  margin-top: 2px;
  font-size: 13px;
  color: var(--text-2);
  max-width: 420px;
}
.tag {
  display: inline-block;
  padding: 2px 8px;
  font-size: 12px;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 999px;
  color: var(--text-2);
  white-space: nowrap;
}
.gain { min-width: 120px; }
.gain-value { font-weight: 600; color: var(--accent); }
.bar {
  display: block;
  height: 6px;
  margin-top: 6px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent), var(--accent-soft));
  min-width: 2px;
}
.is-new .tag { color: var(--accent); border-color: var(--accent); }

/* ---------- 趋势图 ---------- */
.chart-figure { margin: 0; }
.chart-figure svg {
  width: 100%;
  height: auto;
  background: var(--surface);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 12px;
}
.chart-figure text { fill: var(--text-2); font-size: 12px; }
.grid-line { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
.chart-legend {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 12px 20px;
  margin-top: 12px;
  font-size: 13px;
  color: var(--text-2);
}
.legend-swatch {
  display: inline-block;
  width: 10px;
  height: 10px;
  border-radius: 3px;
  margin-right: 6px;
}
details {
  margin-top: 12px;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 10px;
  background: var(--surface);
  padding: 12px 16px;
}
summary { cursor: pointer; font-size: 14px; }

/* ---------- 点评与方法 ---------- */
#commentary ul { padding-left: 22px; }
#commentary li { margin: 6px 0; }
.note { color: var(--text-2); font-size: 13px; }
.method-list { padding-left: 22px; color: var(--text-2); font-size: 14px; }
.method-list li { margin: 6px 0; }

footer {
  border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  padding: 20px;
  text-align: center;
  color: var(--text-2);
  font-size: 13px;
}

/* ---------- 响应式 ---------- */
@media (min-width: 768px) {
  .stats-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); }
}
@media (max-width: 767px) {
  .brand h1 { font-size: 17px; }
  main { padding: 16px 14px 40px; }
  th { top: 61px; }
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  *, *::before, *::after {
    transition: none !important;
    animation: none !important;
    scroll-behavior: auto !important;
  }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<a class="skip-link" href="#main">跳到主要内容</a>

<header class="site-header">
  <div class="header-inner">
    <div class="brand">
      <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
        <path d="M8 0C3.58 0 0 3.58 0 8c0 3.54 2.29 6.53 5.47 7.59.4.07.55-.17.55-.38 0-.19-.01-.82-.01-1.49-2.01.37-2.53-.49-2.69-.94-.09-.23-.48-.94-.82-1.13-.28-.15-.68-.52-.01-.53.63-.01 1.08.58 1.23.82.72 1.21 1.87.87 2.33.66.07-.52.28-.87.51-1.07-1.78-.2-3.64-.89-3.64-3.95 0-.87.31-1.59.82-2.15-.08-.2-.36-1.02.08-2.12 0 0 .67-.21 2.2.82.64-.18 1.32-.27 2-.27s1.36.09 2 .27c1.53-1.04 2.2-.82 2.2-.82.44 1.1.16 1.92.08 2.12.51.56.82 1.27.82 2.15 0 3.07-1.87 3.75-3.65 3.95.29.25.54.73.54 1.48 0 1.07-.01 1.93-.01 2.2 0 .21.15.46.55.38A8.01 8.01 0 0 0 16 8c0-4.42-3.58-8-8-8Z"/>
      </svg>
      <div>
        <h1>{{ title }}</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">数据截至 {{ date }}{% if previous_date %} · 对比 {{ previous_date }}{% endif %} · 每周更新 · 快照差值口径</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <button class="theme-toggle" id="theme-toggle" type="button" aria-label="切换亮色 / 暗色主题" title="切换主题">
      <svg class="icon-sun" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true">
        <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/><path d="M12 2v2m0 16v2M4.93 4.93l1.41 1.41m11.32 11.32 1.41 1.41M2 12h2m16 0h2M4.93 19.07l1.41-1.41M17.66 6.34l1.41-1.41"/>
      </svg>
      <svg class="icon-moon" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
        <path d="M21 12.79A9 9 0 1 1 11.21 3 7 7 0 0 0 21 12.79Z"/>
      </svg>
    </button>
  </div>
</header>

<main id="main">
  <section class="stats-grid" aria-label="本周摘要">
    {% for card in stats_cards %}
    <div class="stat-card">
      <div class="stat-value">{{ card.value }}</div>
      <div class="stat-label">{{ card.label }}</div>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </section>

  <section id="main-ranking" aria-labelledby="main-ranking-title">
    <h2 id="main-ranking-title">本周主榜 Top {{ main|length }}</h2>
    <p class="section-note">{{ main_note }}</p>
    <div class="table-scroll">
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th scope="col">#</th>
            <th scope="col">仓库</th>
            <th scope="col">分类</th>
            <th scope="col">语言</th>
            <th scope="col" class="num">总星标</th>
            <th scope="col" class="num">本周新增</th>
            <th scope="col" class="num">日均估算</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {% for item in main %}
          <tr{% if item.is_new %} class="is-new"{% endif %}>
            <td class="rank">{{ item.rank }}</td>
            <td>
              <a href="{{ item.record.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{ item.full_name }}</a>
              {% if item.record.description %}<div class="repo-desc">{{ item.record.description }}</div>{% endif %}
            </td>
            <td><span class="tag">{{ item.category_label }}</span></td>
            <td>{{ item.record.language or "—" }}</td>
            <td class="num">{{ item.stars_fmt }}</td>
            <td class="num gain">
              {% if item.weekly_gain is not none %}
              <span class="gain-value">+{{ item.gain_fmt }}</span>
              <span class="bar" style="width: {{ item.bar_pct }}%" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              {% else %}—{% endif %}
            </td>
            <td class="num">{% if item.daily_est is not none %}+{{ item.daily_fmt }}{% else %}—{% endif %}</td>
          </tr>
          {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </section>

  {% if new_faces %}
  <section id="new-faces" aria-labelledby="new-faces-title">
    <h2 id="new-faces-title">新面孔（本周新上榜）</h2>
    <p class="section-note">上一期未进入榜单、本期首次上榜的仓库，按总星标排序。</p>
    <div class="table-scroll">
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th scope="col">#</th>
            <th scope="col">仓库</th>
            <th scope="col">分类</th>
            <th scope="col">语言</th>
            <th scope="col" class="num">总星标</th>
            <th scope="col" class="num">本周新增</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {% for item in new_faces %}
          <tr>
            <td class="rank">{{ item.rank }}</td>
            <td>
              <a href="{{ item.record.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{ item.full_name }}</a>
              {% if item.record.description %}<div class="repo-desc">{{ item.record.description }}</div>{% endif %}
            </td>
            <td><span class="tag">{{ item.category_label }}</span></td>
            <td>{{ item.record.language or "—" }}</td>
            <td class="num">{{ item.stars_fmt }}</td>
            <td class="num gain">
              {% if item.weekly_gain is not none %}
              <span class="gain-value">+{{ item.gain_fmt }}</span>
              <span class="bar" style="width: {{ item.bar_pct }}%" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              {% else %}—{% endif %}
            </td>
          </tr>
          {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </section>
  {% endif %}

  {% if categories %}
  <section id="categories" aria-labelledby="categories-title">
    <h2 id="categories-title">分类子榜</h2>
    {% for label, items in categories %}
    <h3>{{ label }} Top {{ items|length }}</h3>
    <div class="table-scroll">
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th scope="col">#</th>
            <th scope="col">仓库</th>
            <th scope="col">语言</th>
            <th scope="col" class="num">总星标</th>
            <th scope="col" class="num">本周新增</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {% for item in items %}
          <tr>
            <td class="rank">{{ item.rank }}</td>
            <td><a href="{{ item.record.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{ item.full_name }}</a></td>
            <td>{{ item.record.language or "—" }}</td>
            <td class="num">{{ item.stars_fmt }}</td>
            <td class="num">{% if item.weekly_gain is not none %}+{{ item.gain_fmt }}{% else %}—{% endif %}</td>
          </tr>
          {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </section>
  {% endif %}

  {% if trend %}
  <section id="trend" aria-labelledby="trend-title">
    <h2 id="trend-title">近期趋势</h2>
    <p class="section-note">{{ trend.summary }}</p>
    <figure class="chart-figure">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 {{ trend.width }} {{ trend.total_height }}" role="img" aria-label="{{ trend.summary }}" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
        <title>{{ trend.summary }}</title>
        {% for tick in trend.y_ticks %}
        <line class="grid-line" x1="0" y1="{{ tick.y }}" x2="{{ trend.width }}" y2="{{ tick.y }}"/>
        <text x="4" y="{{ tick.y - 4 }}">{{ tick.value }}</text>
        {% endfor %}
        {% for d in trend.dates %}
        <text x="{{ d.x }}" y="{{ trend.total_height - 10 }}" text-anchor="middle">{{ d.label }}</text>
        {% endfor %}
        {% for s in trend.series %}
        {% if s.line %}<path d="{{ s.line }}" fill="none" stroke="{{ s.color }}" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-dasharray="{{ s.dash }}" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>{% endif %}
        {% for dot in s.dots %}
        <circle cx="{{ dot.cx }}" cy="{{ dot.cy }}" r="3.5" fill="{{ s.color }}">
          <title>{{ s.name }} · {{ dot.stars|fmt }} 星</title>
        </circle>
        {% endfor %}
        {% endfor %}
      </svg>
      <figcaption class="chart-legend">
        {% for s in trend.series %}
        <span><span class="legend-swatch" style="background: {{ s.color }}"></span>{{ s.name }} · {{ s.latest|fmt }} 星（{{ "%+d"|format(s.delta) }}）</span>
        {% endfor %}
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
    <details>
      <summary>查看趋势数据表</summary>
      <div class="table-scroll">
        <table>
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th scope="col">仓库</th>
              {% for d in trend.table.dates %}<th scope="col" class="num">{{ d[5:] }}</th>{% endfor %}
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            {% for row in trend.table.rows %}
            <tr>
              <td>{{ row.name }}</td>
              {% for value in row.points %}<td class="num">{{ value|fmt }}</td>{% endfor %}
            </tr>
            {% endfor %}
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </details>
  </section>
  {% endif %}

  <section id="commentary" aria-labelledby="commentary-title">
    <h2 id="commentary-title">本周探讨</h2>
    {% if commentary %}
    <ul>
      {% for item in commentary %}<li>{{ item }}</li>{% endfor %}
    </ul>
    {% else %}
    <p class="note">暂无自动点评。</p>
    {% endif %}
    <p class="note">点评为基于数据规则自动生成的草稿，可在合并 PR 前人工润色补充。</p>
  </section>

  <section id="methodology" aria-labelledby="methodology-title">
    <h2 id="methodology-title">数据与方法</h2>
    <ul class="method-list">
      <li>数据来源：GitHub REST API（Search API 按 topic 发现 + repos 端点抓取种子清单），每周生成一次快照。</li>
      <li>榜单口径：总星标 ≥ 1000，排除 fork、已归档与模板仓库；周增量 = 本期快照 − 上期快照。</li>
      <li>日均估算 = 周增量 ÷ 7（GitHub 未提供直接的周增量接口，超大仓库 stargazer 历史亦有 4 万条上限，因此日均列为估算值）。</li>
      <li>分类：种子清单预设 + 仓库自身 topic 自动推断，未命中显示为「未分类」。</li>
      <li>快照与历史报告均保存在仓库中，可回溯校验。</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</main>

<footer>
  {{ title }} · 数据截至 {{ date }} · 生成脚本开源在项目仓库，欢迎在合并前修订点评
</footer>

<script>
(function () {
  var root = document.documentElement;
  var saved = null;
  try { saved = localStorage.getItem("gh-ai-theme"); } catch (e) {}
  if (saved === "light" || saved === "dark") {
    root.dataset.theme = saved;
  }
  var toggle = document.getElementById("theme-toggle");
  toggle.addEventListener("click", function () {
    var next = root.dataset.theme === "dark" ? "light" : "dark";
    root.dataset.theme = next;
    try { localStorage.setItem("gh-ai-theme", next); } catch (e) {}
    toggle.setAttribute("aria-label", next === "dark" ? "切换到亮色主题" : "切换到暗色主题");
  });
})();
</script>
</body>
</html>
